<title>USA: BT confirms interest in MCI merger.</title>
<headline>BT confirms interest in MCI merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc on Friday confirmed its interest in merging with MCI Communications Corp.</p>
<p>A spokesman said that the company's board would meet this weekend to consider a proposal, but there was no guarantee that any deal would go through.</p>
<p>If it did, any statement would be issued on Monday morning before the London stock market opened, he said.  There were no further details. -- New York Newsroom 212 859 1610</p>
